# Rebuild the Projection and Switch Session Search

## Step

Resolved when existing accepted Runs and compatible observation pages rebuild into the versioned projection; `session search` defaults to reflections then supporting observations with evidence links; `--raw` and inspect retain bounded evidence access; rollback is mechanical; health checks cover freshness, schema failures, and projector lag; and the twice-daily capture repair can replay missed evidence without duplicating observations.
